{"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "query": "Unit tests for an Arduino Uno module: Wake-up light: alarm clock with slow LED fade-in, IR remote, 16x2 I2C LCD and RTC. Pins: pin 14 INPUT IR receiver (A0); pin 5 OUTPUT white LED strip (PWM, alarm light); pin 6 OUTPUT red LED strip (PWM, soft/night light); pin 9 OUTPUT LCD backlight (PWM); pin 2 OUTPUT ticker buzzer; pin 18 I2C SDA (A4): LCD and RTC; pin 19 I2C SCL (A5). Arduino API used: analogWrite, delay, digitalWrite, millis, pinMode. Libraries: IRremote, LiquidCrystal I2C. Library API used: backlight, begin, clear, createChar, decode, enableIRIn, init, print, resume, setCursor, write. Simulated devices: wokwi-ds1307, wokwi-lcd1602, wokwi-ir-receiver. Functions to test: void wake_reset_state(), void wake_init(), void wake_loop(), void wake_loop_with(unsigned long now_ms, unsigned long ir_code), void HandleIRCode(unsigned long code), byte decToBcd(byte val), byte bcdToDec(byte val), void ActivateNightLight(), void DecreaseTickerInterval(), void ToggleTicker(), void LightOn(), void LightOff(), void SetBrightness(int brightnessValue), void PushedAnyButton(), void ToggleActiveLEDStrip(), bool OnceEverySecond(), void ReadTime(), void CheckAlarm(), void Alarm(), void RefreshLCD(), String DayOfWeekForLCD(), void PrintTimeValueOnLCD(byte value), void ChangeBrightness(int step), void IncreaseAlarmHour(), void IncreaseAlarmMinute(), void ToggleAlarm(), void CheckDayOrNight(), void SetLCDBacklight(), void setDS3231time(byte second, byte minute, byte hour, byte dayOfWeek, byte dayOfMonth, byte month, byte year), void readDS3231time(byte *second, byte *minute, byte *hour, byte *dayOfWeek, byte *dayOfMonth, byte *month, byte *year).", "embedding": [-0.048065185546875, -0.00353240966796875, -0.039947509765625, -0.040252685546875, -0.01812744140625, 0.001552581787109375, 0.01506805419921875, -0.035400390625, 0.0386962890625, 0.00997161865234375, 0.0014019012451171875, -0.019317626953125, -0.044464111328125, 0.050384521484375, 0.04